			]
			description: [
				"An Encased Fan blowing into a Pressurizer's vessel feeds it air, and from 256 RPM the Pressurizer squeezes it hot. A Steel Condenser with coolant in its jacket chills it, and an aluminium Expansion Valve lets it through, a fifth of it turning liquid."
				""
				"The rest comes out cold, to go round again."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Liquefying tab.&r"
			]
			id: "6E06FDD802380DCB"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Squeeze, chill, let go"
			tasks: [
				{
