			]
			description: [
				"Iron nuggets pressed with alumina make iron catalyst pellets. Dropped into a Pressurizer's vessel, a pellet lets nitrogen and hydrogen squeeze into ammonia over &6Hot&r heat."
				""
				"Ammonia squeezed with carbon dioxide gives urea, which is bone meal by the bucket: on a crop it grows one stage."
